packages/task/references/executor-handoff.md:1: # Executor handoff
packages/task/references/executor-handoff.md:2: 
packages/task/references/executor-handoff.md:3: You implement one unit or item for the integrator who dispatched you. Your input is the JSON brief the
packages/task/references/executor-handoff.md:4: integrator gives you. Implement only its scope and edit only its files; follow its rules, decisions and
packages/task/references/executor-handoff.md:5: guidance. Do not read or edit plan files, do not run `plan.py`, do not commit: the integrator records
packages/task/references/executor-handoff.md:6: and commits. Run each check exactly as written and keep long output in a file. Stop on a needed
packages/task/references/executor-handoff.md:7: decision, a path outside your files, or an owner action, and say so.
packages/task/references/executor-handoff.md:8: 
packages/task/references/executor-handoff.md:9: Return to the integrator:
packages/task/references/executor-handoff.md:10: - `summary`: what changed and why, in a few lines.
packages/task/references/executor-handoff.md:11: - `changed_paths`: every path you created, modified or deleted.
